  "content": "<div class=\"mwsmediaplayer section\">\n\n    <script type=\"application/ld+json\">{ \n     \n      \"@context\":\"http://schema.org/\",\n      \"@type\": \"WebPage\",\n      \"image\":\"https://www.canada.ca/content/dam/canada/social-media/canada.png\",\n      \"name\": \"Improving Life for Youth\",\n      \"description\": \"Whether you want to improve your health or kick-start your career, the Government of Canada has a wide range of Tools to get you started. The Government of Canada has tools and information to help youth focus on their future; whether it be how to stay healthy or how to gain new skills.\",\n      \"speakable\": \n      { \"@type\": \"SpeakableSpecification\",\"cssSelector\": [\".speakable1\",\".speakable2\"]  } ,\n      \"keywords\":\"youth, young adults, teens, improve, health, career, Canada, government, future\",\n      \"url\":\"https://www.canada.ca/en/services/youth.html\"}\n            \n      </script><p class=\"speakable1 hidden\">Whether you want to improve your health or kick-start your career, the Government of Canada has a wide range of tools to get you started. Learn more by visiting Canada.ca.</p>\n\n<p class=\"speakable2 hidden\">The Government of Canada has tools and information to help youth focus on their future; whether it be how to stay healthy or how to gain new skills. To learn more, visit Canada.ca.</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"mwsmediaplayer section\">\n\n    <div class=\"yth-hdr\">\n\t<div class=\"yth-hdr-fltr\">\n\t\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"inner row\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-7\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1 property=\"name\" id=\"wb-cont\"><strong>Youth</strong><br>in Canada</h1>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>Take charge of your future today. Get started with Government of Canada programs, tools and job opportunities to gain experience, grow your skills and land your first job in high-demand sectors.</p>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"yth-feature bg-info\">\n\t<section class=\"container\"><div class=\"mrgn-tp-xl mrgn-bttm-xl\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"mrgn-tp-0 mrgn-bttm-lg\">Special features</h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"row d-sm-flex\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"col-sm-6 d-flex\"><div class=\"brdr-bttm d-flex\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"mrgn-tp-0\"><a class=\"stretched-link\" href=\"/en/employment-social-development/services/funding/canada-summer-jobs/youth.html\">Find Canada Summer Jobs</a></h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"h5\">Up to 100,000 Canada Summer Jobs available for youth this summer!</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mrgn-bttm-lg hidden-sm hidden-md hidden-lg\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"align-self-center mrgn-lft-md\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"h3\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-menu-right\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mrgn-bttm-xl hidden-sm hidden-md hidden-lg\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</section><section class=\"col-sm-6 d-flex\"><div class=\"brdr-bttm d-flex\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mrgn-bttm-lg hidden-sm hidden-md hidden-lg\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"mrgn-tp-0\"><a class=\"stretched-link\" href=\"/en/employment-social-development/services/student-work-placements-stem-business.html\">Find work placements in your field of study</a></h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"h5\">Up to 55,000 work placements for post-secondary students in 2026–27!</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mrgn-bttm-lg hidden-sm hidden-md hidden-lg\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"align-self-center h3 mrgn-lft-md\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-menu-right\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</section></div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</section></div>\n<div class=\"yth-pathway\">\n\t<section class=\"container\"><h2>Choose your pathway</h2>\n\t\t<div class=\"row wb-eqht-grd\">\n\t\t\t<section class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-6\"><div class=\"panel panel-success brdr-0 hght-inhrt\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-body bg-success hght-inhrt\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img class=\"img-responsive center-block hidden-xs\" src=\"/content/dam/esdc-edsc/images/services/youth/2026-04-redesign/thumbnail-shape-career.jpg\" alt=\"\"><div class=\"panel panel-default brdr-0 hght-inhrt mrgn-bttm-0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-body hght-inhrt\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mrgn-tp-md hidden-xs\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"mrgn-tp-0\">Shape your career</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Explore what interests you and what careers are in demand.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mt-auto mrgn-bttm-0\"><a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.jobbank.gc.ca/career-planning\" class=\"btn btn-success\">Learn more about shaping your career</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</section><section class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-6\"><div class=\"panel panel-info brdr-0 hght-inhrt\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-body bg-info hght-inhrt\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img class=\"img-responsive center-block hidden-xs\" src=\"/content/dam/esdc-edsc/images/services/youth/2026-04-redesign/thumbnail-education.jpg\" alt=\"\"><div class=\"panel panel-default brdr-0 hght-inhrt mrgn-bttm-0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-body hght-inhrt\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mrgn-tp-md hidden-xs\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"mrgn-tp-0\">Get money to study</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Build your future with the right tools and support.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mt-auto mrgn-bttm-0\"><a href=\"/en/services/benefits/education.html\" class=\"btn btn-info\">Learn more about planning your education</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</section><section class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-6\"><div class=\"panel panel-warning brdr-0 hght-inhrt\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-body bg-warning hght-inhrt\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img class=\"img-responsive center-block hidden-xs\" src=\"/content/dam/esdc-edsc/images/services/youth/2026-04-redesign/thumbnail-skill-building.jpg\" alt=\"\"><div class=\"panel panel-default brdr-0 hght-inhrt mrgn-bttm-0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-body hght-inhrt\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mrgn-tp-md hidden-xs\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"mrgn-tp-0\">Shift into work mode</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Use the School to Work Transition Tool to find what jobs graduates have and how much they earn.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mt-auto mrgn-bttm-0\"><a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.jobbank.gc.ca/career-planning/school-work-transition\" class=\"btn btn-warning\">Learn more about transitioning to work</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</section><section class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-6\"><div class=\"panel panel-danger brdr-0 hght-inhrt\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-body bg-danger hght-inhrt\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img class=\"img-responsive center-block hidden-xs\" src=\"/content/dam/esdc-edsc/images/services/youth/2026-04-redesign/thumbnail-job-search.jpg\" alt=\"\"><div class=\"panel panel-default brdr-0 hght-inhrt mrgn-bttm-0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-body hght-inhrt\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mrgn-tp-md hidden-xs\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"mrgn-tp-0\">Kick-start your job search</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Find meaningful work that aligns with your goals.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mt-auto mrgn-bttm-0\"><a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.jobbank.gc.ca/youth\" class=\"btn btn-danger\">Learn more about kick-starting your job search</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</section></div>\n\t\t<div class=\"mrgn-bttm-lg\"></div>\n\t</section></div>\n<div class=\"yth-about bg-info\">\n\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"mrgn-bttm-lg\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"col-sm-6 col-md-4\"><h2>Discover careers in the skilled trades</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>Join the skilled trades and be part of building a stronger Canada.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p><a href=\"/en/employment-social-development/campaigns/skilled-trades.html\">Learn more about the skilled trades</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t</section><section class=\"col-sm-6 col-md-4 col-md-offset-4\"><h2>Stay connected</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>For the latest in government opportunities, federal updates, insights and exciting programs for youth, follow us on Instagram.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"yth-social followus wb-init followus-inited\" id=\"wb-auto-4\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mrgn-bttm-0\"><a class=\"instagram\" rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/youthincanada/\"><img src=\"/content/dam/esdc-edsc/images/campaigns/youth/ysi/icon-instagram-sm.png\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"wb-inv\">Instagram: </span>@youthincanada<span class=\"px-2\"></span></a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</section></div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"mwsgeneric-base-html parbase section\">\n\n\n\n    <div class=\"container\">\n\t</div>\n\n\n</div>"
